From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: koyu <me@koyu.space>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 04:55:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 08/18] Add a wallpaper page

Lets the user pick the desktop wallpaper from the ones listed in
plasma-setup/wallpapers.json, with its default preselected. Thumbnails
follow the light/dark choice. The pick is kept in the setup user's
plasma-setuprc and written into the desktop containment of the new
user's layout along with the theme.

